 r←Test_FileBox_002(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;⎕TRAP;path;n
⍝ Exercise the "Create" method with some parameters.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1
 myGuiParms.caption←0⊃⎕XSI
 myGuiParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.FileBox.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.style←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi

 n←myGuiParms parms #._APLGUI.GUI.FileBox.Create'C:\Windows\'

 r←∆OK
